      "created_at": "2011-08-12T19:11:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>With the Wraith’s card Combat Stance it says the first time she is dealt damage she deals two melee damage that target. So if you reduce the damage something will deal to you to zero for example Voss’s 2 fire damage to the lowest hp does she get dealt zero damage and hits him or does she just not get dealt damage and nothing happens?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:36.909Z",
