    {
      "id": 21238,
      "name": "Tamar",
      "username": "Tamar",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/85f322/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-12T19:45:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you’ve reduced the damage, like with her innate power, enough that it is reduced to 0, then she isn’t actually damaged and the power on Combat stance won’t trigger.<br>\nIf she’s reducing by 2 and gets hit for 4, then those other 2 points would slip through and deal The Wraith damage, triggering Combat stance and letting her hit whoever hit her.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:55:20.326Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
